outline-variant hover:text-on-surface"><a href="#">Sprint &amp; Circuitos Urbanos</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-outline-variant hover:text-on-surface"><a href="#">Hitos de Persecución &amp; Bolsa</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-outline-variant hover:text-on-surface"><a href="#">Pruebas de Aceleración (Drag)</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-outline-variant hover:text-on-surface"><a href="#">Cabinas de Radar (Speedtrap)</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-outline-variant hover:text-on-surface"><a href="#">Tiempos Any% y 100%</a></li></ul></div><div class="space-y-space-sm"><span class="font-label-hud text-label-hud text-primary uppercase block tracking-wider">RECURSOS &amp; TELEMETRÍA</span><ul class="space-y-space-xs font-body-sm text-body-sm"><li class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-outline-variant hover:text-on-surface"><a href="#">NFSMW Live Telemetry Hook</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-outline-variant hover:text-on-surface"><a href="#">Extra Options &amp; Config Standard</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-outline-variant hover:text-on-surface"><a href="#">Descarga de Ghost Saves (.sav)</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-outline-variant hover:text-on-surface"><a href="#">Calculadora de Ratio de Marchas</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-outline-variant hover:text-on-surface"><a href="#">Inspector de Rutas por Satélite</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-outline-variant hover:text-on-surface"><a href="#">Reglamento de Speedrun 2024</a></li></ul></div><div class="space-y-space-sm"><span class="font-label-hud text-label-hud text-primary uppercase block tracking-wider">ESTADO DEL SISTEMA</span><div class="space-y-space-xs font-label-data text-label-data"><div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="text-outline">NODO ROCKPORT CENTRAL</span><span class="text-primary">OPERATIVO</span></div><div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="text-outline">MOTOR DE VERIFICACIÓN</span><span class="text-tertiary">ACTIVO (99.98%)</span></div><div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="text-outline">SUBMISIONES PENDIENTES</span><span class="text-on-surface">14 CORREDORES</span></div><div class="flex justify-between items-center"><span class="text-outline">ÚLTIMO RECORD MUNDIAL</span><span class="text-secondary-container">HACE 24M</span></div></div><div class="pt-space-xs"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-label-hud text-label-hud text-primary-container uppercase hover:text-primary" href="#"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">terminal</span><span>CONSULTAR PROTOCOLO COMPLETO</span></a></div></div></div><div class="pt-space-lg flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-space-md font-body-sm text-body-sm text-outline"><p>© 2024 NFSMW Ranks Community. Need for Speed™ y Most Wanted™ son marcas registradas de Electronic Arts Inc. Este proyecto es una base de datos competitiva comunitaria independiente sin ánimo de lucro.</p><div class="flex items-center gap-space-lg font-label-data text-label-data text-outline"><a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">TÉRMINOS DE RANKING</a><a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">PRIVACIDAD &amp; LOGS</a><a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">DISCORD SERVER</a><a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">GITHUB REPO</a></div></div></div></footer>

